{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07310","headline":"石梁湖有寄 · 刘长卿","name":"石梁湖有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人千里道，沧波一年别。\n夜上明月楼，相思楚天阔。\n潇潇清秋暮，嫋嫋凉风发。\n湖色淡不流，沙鸥远还灭。\n烟波日已远，音问日已绝。\n岁晏空含情，江臯绿芳歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07310.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07310","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}